  <div id="results"><pre class="ok">UI manifest separates fourteen assets from a replaceable context plate</pre><pre class="ok">UI exports decode at native dimensions and match their recorded hashes</pre><pre class="ok">Component shadows stay local; live type and context never inherit a filter</pre><pre class="ok">Notebook edge and PNG receive one union shadow; wash follows native alpha</pre><pre class="ok">Lighting A/B preserves selection, copy, native typography and click geometry</pre><pre class="ok">Bright, dark, patterned and scene contexts preserve the exact UI markup</pre><pre class="ok">Logo mark and catalog wordmark remain reusable and explicitly optional</pre><pre class="ok">All UI copy stays catalog-backed with loaded fonts and native bounds</pre><pre class="ok">Shadows and alpha decorations cannot intercept continue or scaled choices</pre><pre class="ok">Keyboard selection retains focus and fires callbacks exactly once</pre><pre class="ok">Local clip, shadow, gradient and alpha-mask IDs cannot collide across instances</pre><pre class="ok">UI mask hash and size are fixed and uncertainty is explicitly recorded</pre><pre class="ok">Masked comparison ignores context pixels and exposes UI changes</pre><pre class="ok">Alpha-only UI errors stay visible; empty and wrong-sized masks fail</pre><pre class="ok">Invalid presentation and capture requests cannot partially mutate state</pre><pre class="ok">Static capture resets light/logo/choice/layers and disables all callbacks</pre><pre class="ok">Inspection and disposal leave no active SVG or late action path</pre><p class="ok">17/17 passed</p></div>
